msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
